(7271261, 1131910, 138253, '<td valign="top">tryin to make the front-page, dpc news?</td>', 'tryin to make the front-page, dpc news?', '2014-10-08 10:07:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7271263, 1132035, 138253, '<td valign="top">when i see this, all i can see is the monolith from 2001, and like it, this is an image that may cause some violent reactions from voters, while opening the eyes of others to look at the world differently.<br/>well...maybe not the last one, but it will definitely draw some repeat viewings :)</td>', 'when i see this, all i can see is the monolith from 2001, and like it, this is an image that may cause some violent reactions from voters, while opening the eyes of others to look at the world differently.well...maybe not the last one, but it will definitely draw some repeat viewings :)', '2014-10-08 10:10:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7271265, 1131922, 138253, '<td valign="top">i love the looks here - the girl looks actuely interested in what the guy is thinking, trying to read him, genuinely concerned with what he has to say, and he has a look on his face that speaks of carefree afternoons spent just laying about, not contemplating whatever it is that the girl wants him to be contemplating.<br/>for the style of odreiw specifically, the image is off balance with muted tones, drawing you to the faces of your human subjects, but with the legs raised in a defense manner telling you to stay back and not be drawn in, so you did a good job in the dichotomy that i find in his images - the push/pull and seeming intentional unbalancing of the viewer.<br/>i''m giving this a 10</td>', 'i love the looks here - the girl looks actuely interested in what the guy is thinking, trying to read him, genuinely concerned with what he has to say, and he has a look on his face that speaks of carefree afternoons spent just laying about, not contemplating whatever it is that the girl wants him to be contemplating.for the style of odreiw specifically, the image is off balance with muted tones, drawing you to the faces of your human subjects, but with the legs raised in a defense manner telling you to stay back and not be drawn in, so you did a good job in the dichotomy that i find in his images - the push/pull and seeming intentional unbalancing of the viewer.i''m giving this a 10', '2014-10-08 10:15:21.000000', NULL, 1),
