(7271452, 1131744, 138253, '<td valign="top">bumpity bump up to a 9.<br/>this has some very contradictory elements - the warm tones permeating through imply warmth, the shadowy (slightly deformed) upper body seem alien and possibly dangerouns, the hand an outstretched warning or an invitation.<br/>the handprints and water drops make for a very interesting element on their own, adding a natural texture to the image, and the "divide" showing rural north america on a quiet street give a strong balance to both the warm tones and comforting feeling, that this is all going to be okay; where the same image provides a nice counter balance to the shadowy "you don''t really know who lives next to you" mindset.</td>', 'bumpity bump up to a 9.this has some very contradictory elements - the warm tones permeating through imply warmth, the shadowy (slightly deformed) upper body seem alien and possibly dangerouns, the hand an outstretched warning or an invitation.the handprints and water drops make for a very interesting element on their own, adding a natural texture to the image, and the "divide" showing rural north america on a quiet street give a strong balance to both the warm tones and comforting feeling, that this is all going to be okay; where the same image provides a nice counter balance to the shadowy "you don''t really know who lives next to you" mindset.', '2014-10-08 16:15:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7271480, 1131508, 75618, '<td valign="top">I love the narrow focus and the post processing creating a warm, dreamy atmosphere. Sorry to sound nitpicky but I think it would have been better if the horizon was cropped out or if there was a little bit more sky.</td>', 'I love the narrow focus and the post processing creating a warm, dreamy atmosphere. Sorry to sound nitpicky but I think it would have been better if the horizon was cropped out or if there was a little bit more sky.', '2014-10-08 17:56:26.000000', NULL, 1),
