(7271561, 1131922, 124815, '<td valign="top">If this is not Jedi himself, it better be. It reminds me of a little story about Picasso''s portrait of Gertrude Stein. When someone commented that Stein did not look like her portrait, Picasso replied: "she will". And she did!<br/>bump</td>', 'If this is not Jedi himself, it better be. It reminds me of a little story about Picasso''s portrait of Gertrude Stein. When someone commented that Stein did not look like her portrait, Picasso replied: "she will". And she did!bump', '2014-10-09 01:02:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7271563, 1131744, 124815, '<td valign="top">The parameters are "Odriew style" but I cannot vote on the likeness only or it will be a fraud. <br/>This is a solid image on its own.<br/>bump</td>', 'The parameters are "Odriew style" but I cannot vote on the likeness only or it will be a fraud. This is a solid image on its own.bump', '2014-10-09 01:03:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7271564, 1131736, 124815, '<td valign="top">An elegant image in spite of its subject. The elegance of living one''s life in the terms it was given, I suppose.<br/>bump</td>', 'An elegant image in spite of its subject. The elegance of living one''s life in the terms it was given, I suppose.bump', '2014-10-09 01:03:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7271565, 1131830, 124815, '<td valign="top">Looking through Jedi''s glass in a good sense; sort of new Alice in Wonderland. <br/>bump</td>', 'Looking through Jedi''s glass in a good sense; sort of new Alice in Wonderland. bump', '2014-10-09 01:03:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7271567, 1132017, 124815, '<td valign="top">Could be part of a series, in a way Jedi constructs his photos. Sort of Colette''s novels of Claudine - Claudine a l''ecole, Les vacances de Claudine......Claudine s''en va....  Just substitute the name<br/>Bump</td>', 'Could be part of a series, in a way Jedi constructs his photos. Sort of Colette''s novels of Claudine - Claudine a l''ecole, Les vacances de Claudine......Claudine s''en va....  Just substitute the nameBump', '2014-10-09 01:17:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7271568, 1131941, 124815, '<td valign="top">Little marvel<br/>Bump</td>', 'Little marvelBump', '2014-10-09 01:18:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7271570, 1132029, 124815, '<td valign="top">The way the challenge was formulated it''s quite inhibiting for a commenter. I much prefer "in the style of" then "create a picture that could be mistaken for his work" <br/>I reject the fake and keep a picture that could be insipred by Odriew. Such as this one - and others in the challenge.<br/>Therefore, a bump here</td>', 'The way the challenge was formulated it''s quite inhibiting for a commenter. I much prefer "in the style of" then "create a picture that could be mistaken for his work" I reject the fake and keep a picture that could be insipred by Odriew. Such as this one - and others in the challenge.Therefore, a bump here', '2014-10-09 01:23:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7271572, 1131880, 124815, '<td valign="top">Nice nonchalance<br/>Bump</td>', 'Nice nonchalanceBump', '2014-10-09 01:25:21.000000', NULL, 1),
