(7271579, 1131857, 124815, '<td valign="top">Wonderful image. It does not scream to be Odriew''s but somehow I really don''t want it. You preserve the mildness and softness of his work with a more radical doze of nostalgia<br/>I like it very much<br/>Bump</td>', 'Wonderful image. It does not scream to be Odriew''s but somehow I really don''t want it. You preserve the mildness and softness of his work with a more radical doze of nostalgiaI like it very muchBump', '2014-10-09 01:37:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7271585, 1131703, 25190, '<td valign="top">I like the tones of this image nicely taken good composition and i like how you have made it with the person in this not the centre of attention but it made some part there of ..Well done</td>', 'I like the tones of this image nicely taken good composition and i like how you have made it with the person in this not the centre of attention but it made some part there of ..Well done', '2014-10-09 03:55:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7271586, 1131717, 25190, '<td valign="top">Good perspective i like the angle good detail and composition i really like the B&amp;W really suits this shot</td>', 'Good perspective i like the angle good detail and composition i really like the B&W really suits this shot', '2014-10-09 03:58:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7271595, 1131716, 153814, '<td valign="top">Sure looks like an Odriew to me. Well done.</td>', 'Sure looks like an Odriew to me. Well done.', '2014-10-09 08:15:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7271604, 1131844, 27421, '<td valign="top">excellent...not sure if it''s in the style, but I like it...on your own merit I give a 7</td>', 'excellent...not sure if it''s in the style, but I like it...on your own merit I give a 7', '2014-10-09 09:20:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7271606, 1131736, 38032, '<td valign="top">lovely shot with an interesting composition. I love how we can''t see the land - just water. A great story that meets the challenge very well. 8</td>', 'lovely shot with an interesting composition. I love how we can''t see the land - just water. A great story that meets the challenge very well. 8', '2014-10-09 09:41:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7271607, 1131511, 38032, '<td valign="top">This captured moment is interesting. I like photos that seem like action photos but the characters looks kind of bored or bordering on solemn. I dig it.</td>', 'This captured moment is interesting. I like photos that seem like action photos but the characters looks kind of bored or bordering on solemn. I dig it.', '2014-10-09 09:43:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7271608, 1131674, 38032, '<td valign="top">A <b>wonderful</b> composition with layers of success and interest. Has a classic / timeless feel along with a bit of obvious contemporary elements mixed in. One of my faves in this challenge.</td>', 'A wonderful composition with layers of success and interest. Has a classic / timeless feel along with a bit of obvious contemporary elements mixed in. One of my faves in this challenge.', '2014-10-09 09:45:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7271609, 1131987, 38032, '<td valign="top">I like the almost-hidden elements to this. The stray arm of a girl - with just enough for us to understand it is a girl. Wildlife to draw the eye in and around. Obviously more than about just the boy.</td>', 'I like the almost-hidden elements to this. The stray arm of a girl - with just enough for us to understand it is a girl. Wildlife to draw the eye in and around. Obviously more than about just the boy.', '2014-10-09 09:47:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7271611, 1131553, 38032, '<td valign="top">Really unique and mysterious scene here.</td>', 'Really unique and mysterious scene here.', '2014-10-09 09:51:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7271614, 1131927, 38032, '<td valign="top">Nice morning scene with a real nice composition.</td>', 'Nice morning scene with a real nice composition.', '2014-10-09 09:54:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7271615, 1131503, 38032, '<td valign="top">Nice use of texture. And mirror =)</td>', 'Nice use of texture. And mirror =)', '2014-10-09 09:54:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7271619, 1131713, 38032, '<td valign="top">I really like the processing and the composition is decent. THere are a few things that keep this from being a super high score from me: while the wheel-barrel and natural elements are timeless and rustic, the water bottle helps the composition but takes away form the classic, timeless feel. I also feel like the pose is a bit forced and unnatural looking. I also wonder if maybe the figures in the background could have been cloned out and maybe the background blurrier - those details seem to distract from the minimalistic vibe of odriew. 6</td>', 'I really like the processing and the composition is decent. THere are a few things that keep this from being a super high score from me: while the wheel-barrel and natural elements are timeless and rustic, the water bottle helps the composition but takes away form the classic, timeless feel. I also feel like the pose is a bit forced and unnatural looking. I also wonder if maybe the figures in the background could have been cloned out and maybe the background blurrier - those details seem to distract from the minimalistic vibe of odriew. 6', '2014-10-09 10:07:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7271620, 1132008, 38032, '<td valign="top">beautiful. Meets the challenge well. It feels like the last vision of someone abandoned on a mountaintop. 8</td>', 'beautiful. Meets the challenge well. It feels like the last vision of someone abandoned on a mountaintop. 8', '2014-10-09 10:08:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7271624, 1132020, 38032, '<td valign="top">radiating with life and death. Seems like it would be amazing as a huge print =)</td>', 'radiating with life and death. Seems like it would be amazing as a huge print =)', '2014-10-09 10:15:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7271625, 1131590, 38032, '<td valign="top">I think this captures the detached vibe of an odriew.</td>', 'I think this captures the detached vibe of an odriew.', '2014-10-09 10:17:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7271639, 1131830, 38032, '<td valign="top">I love the composition and the photo itself but the editing seems a bit overdone for me. The far off horizon has become a mere wall. In itself this may be the idea - so in one respect it is about the frustrations of life itself - where the future seems so wide open but the reality of life seems to hold us back as we are mere observers of our fate. But even with the metaphor, the edits aren''t helping this IMHO.</td>', 'I love the composition and the photo itself but the editing seems a bit overdone for me. The far off horizon has become a mere wall. In itself this may be the idea - so in one respect it is about the frustrations of life itself - where the future seems so wide open but the reality of life seems to hold us back as we are mere observers of our fate. But even with the metaphor, the edits aren''t helping this IMHO.', '2014-10-09 11:59:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7271640, 1131857, 38032, '<td valign="top">Ghostly and creepy. Like a photo found at the bottom of a dead photographer''s film scraps and then developed to reveal the clues to a horrible crime.</td>', 'Ghostly and creepy. Like a photo found at the bottom of a dead photographer''s film scraps and then developed to reveal the clues to a horrible crime.', '2014-10-09 12:01:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7271706, 1131883, 38032, '<td valign="top">This is definitely a sexy image. The body language and mood are all captured without revealing even a hint of this person''s face. Certainly fits the spirit of the challenge although not the typical processing seen in most other entries in the challenge, still a really nice, unique pic. 7</td>', 'This is definitely a sexy image. The body language and mood are all captured without revealing even a hint of this person''s face. Certainly fits the spirit of the challenge although not the typical processing seen in most other entries in the challenge, still a really nice, unique pic. 7', '2014-10-09 14:43:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7271708, 1131933, 38032, '<td valign="top">fun treatment and composition</td>', 'fun treatment and composition', '2014-10-09 14:43:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7271710, 1131922, 38032, '<td valign="top">Love the provocative in-your-face angle and almost uncomfortably close candid. Certainly a strong image with the feel of an odriew.</td>', 'Love the provocative in-your-face angle and almost uncomfortably close candid. Certainly a strong image with the feel of an odriew.', '2014-10-09 14:48:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7271712, 1131508, 38032, '<td valign="top">A beautiful portrait. She seems pensive and perhaps reluctant to be photographed. The processing is fantastic and trying to read her mind is inevitable.</td>', 'A beautiful portrait. She seems pensive and perhaps reluctant to be photographed. The processing is fantastic and trying to read her mind is inevitable.', '2014-10-09 14:49:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7271717, 1132038, 38032, '<td valign="top">I like that this is both gritty and pretty. It makes me think of a lost graph of data that is so very important but no one seems to see in the muck of the unsubstantial. Seemingly both contrived and happenstance. VEry nice find / capture. 7</td>', 'I like that this is both gritty and pretty. It makes me think of a lost graph of data that is so very important but no one seems to see in the muck of the unsubstantial. Seemingly both contrived and happenstance. VEry nice find / capture. 7', '2014-10-09 15:22:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7271773, 1131716, 75618, '<td valign="top">Wow, I really love this. That warm sunlight illuminating her hair is just beautiful. Her body posture, the gaze and blurry hand make it appear like a genuine snapshot of a moment during an intimate afternoon walk, instead of something that is posed. As far as post-processing goes, this is my favorite of the bunch. Just the right amount of warmth and glow. I cant wait to see whose entry this is. 9</td>', 'Wow, I really love this. That warm sunlight illuminating her hair is just beautiful. Her body posture, the gaze and blurry hand make it appear like a genuine snapshot of a moment during an intimate afternoon walk, instead of something that is posed. As far as post-processing goes, this is my favorite of the bunch. Just the right amount of warmth and glow. I cant wait to see whose entry this is. 9', '2014-10-09 19:08:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7271775, 1131935, 75618, '<td valign="top">The Wonder Years! Beautiful and enchanting like always. This could only be <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=102278" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">rooum</a> I just realized that majority of the pictures I recently added to my favorites were from you. If this is not Clive, I apologize. =)  9</td>', 'The Wonder Years! Beautiful and enchanting like always. This could only be  rooum I just realized that majority of the pictures I recently added to my favorites were from you. If this is not Clive, I apologize. =)  9', '2014-10-09 19:17:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7271777, 1131888, 75618, '<td valign="top">I could see myself in one of those guys''s shoes because I''ve been looking at this for a few minutes trying to decipher what I''m looking at. Are they mannequins, people in drag? But I think the ambiguity and the clever composition (esp with the sign in the corner) make for a fun and engaging photo. 7</td>', 'I could see myself in one of those guys''s shoes because I''ve been looking at this for a few minutes trying to decipher what I''m looking at. Are they mannequins, people in drag? But I think the ambiguity and the clever composition (esp with the sign in the corner) make for a fun and engaging photo. 7', '2014-10-09 19:25:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7271781, 1131834, 75618, '<td valign="top">Birds of paradise! When we were little, my aunt had a bunch of these growing in her yard and I and a bunch of other kids would pick them and pretend they were powerful wands. She never did figure out who kept picking them. But I digress... This is beautifully understated. I love that lone fallen stalk in contrast with the others. 7</td>', 'Birds of paradise! When we were little, my aunt had a bunch of these growing in her yard and I and a bunch of other kids would pick them and pretend they were powerful wands. She never did figure out who kept picking them. But I digress... This is beautifully understated. I love that lone fallen stalk in contrast with the others. 7', '2014-10-09 19:35:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7271782, 1131922, 75618, '<td valign="top">This is probably not something I would have shot but the bold and interesting perspective and composition is in the spirit of the challenge. I think this really captures the essence of the idealism of young love. And the heart silhouette in the background is quite serendipitous.  7</td>', 'This is probably not something I would have shot but the bold and interesting perspective and composition is in the spirit of the challenge. I think this really captures the essence of the idealism of young love. And the heart silhouette in the background is quite serendipitous.  7', '2014-10-09 19:45:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7271785, 1131503, 75618, '<td valign="top">Beautiful and frightening, a reminder of how short and strange this transitory life is. 7</td>', 'Beautiful and frightening, a reminder of how short and strange this transitory life is. 7', '2014-10-09 19:58:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7271786, 1131857, 75618, '<td valign="top">An elaborate fantasy. 9</td>', 'An elaborate fantasy. 9', '2014-10-09 20:07:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7271922, 1131716, 170281, '<td valign="top">Truly fits his style and works in this challenge.  Great image!</td>', 'Truly fits his style and works in this challenge.  Great image!', '2014-10-10 08:18:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7271924, 1131935, 170281, '<td valign="top">Terrific image.  The framing and keeping with the challenge is excellent.</td>', 'Terrific image.  The framing and keeping with the challenge is excellent.', '2014-10-10 08:22:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7271927, 1131508, 170281, '<td valign="top">Very nice!  This looks like it came right out of his collection.</td>', 'Very nice!  This looks like it came right out of his collection.', '2014-10-10 08:28:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7271928, 1131928, 170281, '<td valign="top">Very interesting image.  I would like to know the context.  Good framing and action capture.</td>', 'Very interesting image.  I would like to know the context.  Good framing and action capture.', '2014-10-10 08:32:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7272190, 1131872, 124815, '<td valign="top">Lovely romantic image with a more static quality of getleness then Odriew''s. Somehow between him and RKT. <br/>Bump</td>', 'Lovely romantic image with a more static quality of getleness then Odriew''s. Somehow between him and RKT. Bump', '2014-10-11 00:23:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7272204, 1131935, 15511, '<td valign="top">Your title is also superb...</td>', 'Your title is also superb...', '2014-10-11 03:15:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7272211, 1132031, 75618, '<td valign="top">Otherworldly.  It''s amazing how you transformed an otherwise ordinary scene into something interesting with a creative perspective and processing. 9</td>', 'Otherworldly.  It''s amazing how you transformed an otherwise ordinary scene into something interesting with a creative perspective and processing. 9', '2014-10-11 06:38:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7272212, 1131512, 75618, '<td valign="top">Beautiful light and it''s competently shot and processed. But, with the make-up and the pose, I just find it a little contrived.</td>', 'Beautiful light and it''s competently shot and processed. But, with the make-up and the pose, I just find it a little contrived.', '2014-10-11 06:48:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7272213, 1131830, 75618, '<td valign="top">Lovely scene. However, I think the texture is a little too heavy handed and doesn''t really go well with an otherwise introspective and tranquil shot.</td>', 'Lovely scene. However, I think the texture is a little too heavy handed and doesn''t really go well with an otherwise introspective and tranquil shot.', '2014-10-11 06:54:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7272214, 1131950, 75618, '<td valign="top">I think the sun is a little too high for it to be that time. =P</td>', 'I think the sun is a little too high for it to be that time. =P', '2014-10-11 06:58:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7272215, 1131665, 75618, '<td valign="top">Sorry, just not a big fan of shots of single inanimate objects as I feel like it''s more about the objects rather than the photographer''s vision.</td>', 'Sorry, just not a big fan of shots of single inanimate objects as I feel like it''s more about the objects rather than the photographer''s vision.', '2014-10-11 07:06:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7272216, 1131717, 75618, '<td valign="top">Takes one to know one! Interesting mix of patterns and textures and how the shape of weirdo''s figure is similar to the planter box''s. Creatively composed. 7</td>', 'Takes one to know one! Interesting mix of patterns and textures and how the shape of weirdo''s figure is similar to the planter box''s. Creatively composed. 7', '2014-10-11 07:11:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7272217, 1131989, 75618, '<td valign="top">Beautifully imagined, it''s as if they''re about to engage in an epic battle. I love the striking contrast between the bareness of the left side and the clutter and chaos in the right. I''m usually a big fan of glow but there''s too much in this pic as manifested in the haloing in the trees and leaves. 7</td>', 'Beautifully imagined, it''s as if they''re about to engage in an epic battle. I love the striking contrast between the bareness of the left side and the clutter and chaos in the right. I''m usually a big fan of glow but there''s too much in this pic as manifested in the haloing in the trees and leaves. 7', '2014-10-11 07:19:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7272218, 1131691, 75618, '<td valign="top">I love the ambiguity in this, especially when coupled with that title because it leaves a lot to the imagination. The first thought that came to mind was that this was from a perspective of someone on the ground, probably needing help but everyone just walking past not giving a damn. 7</td>', 'I love the ambiguity in this, especially when coupled with that title because it leaves a lot to the imagination. The first thought that came to mind was that this was from a perspective of someone on the ground, probably needing help but everyone just walking past not giving a damn. 7', '2014-10-11 07:30:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7272219, 1132029, 75618, '<td valign="top">It feels like she is totally lost in her own imagined wonderful world. I''m not a huge fan of the processing and coloration (esp the tones on her skin), which is weird coming from me because I usually like these funky retro colors.</td>', 'It feels like she is totally lost in her own imagined wonderful world. I''m not a huge fan of the processing and coloration (esp the tones on her skin), which is weird coming from me because I usually like these funky retro colors.', '2014-10-11 07:49:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7272235, 1131927, 57447, '<td valign="top">A lot of good odriew elements here.</td>', 'A lot of good odriew elements here.', '2014-10-11 11:45:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7272290, 1131804, 13077, '<td valign="top">I like this one - the sort of enchanted, dark forest vibe comes through well. I like the fact that the kid on the left is wearing a vaguely red hood as well ;)</td>', 'I like this one - the sort of enchanted, dark forest vibe comes through well. I like the fact that the kid on the left is wearing a vaguely red hood as well ;)', '2014-10-11 18:02:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7272291, 1132029, 13077, '<td valign="top">I like the overall atmosphere in this one, and the sharp but surrealistic vibe the girl and the bottom section of the photo have going on. I also like how the balloon string is interrupted by the light, like it''s been burnt and it''s about to fly away.</td>', 'I like the overall atmosphere in this one, and the sharp but surrealistic vibe the girl and the bottom section of the photo have going on. I also like how the balloon string is interrupted by the light, like it''s been burnt and it''s about to fly away.', '2014-10-11 18:04:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7272292, 1131933, 13077, '<td valign="top">The dog is well framed between the posts, and the rest of the photo has just enough going on to make the whole thing work.</td>', 'The dog is well framed between the posts, and the rest of the photo has just enough going on to make the whole thing work.', '2014-10-11 18:05:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7272293, 1131744, 13077, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful. Top-notch - the scene itself, the composition, the processing, the light, it all works.</td>', 'This is beautiful. Top-notch - the scene itself, the composition, the processing, the light, it all works.', '2014-10-11 18:07:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7272296, 1131989, 13077, '<td valign="top">The bold shapes vs. the fluffy clouds are a good contrast, but my favorite part of the photo is the left half. I don''t know if you had the time to wait until some of the ''sentries'' flew over and landed on that more barren tree, but if you had done and somehow composed to have the clouds behind that tree I think it would have improved this.<br/> <br/>The other tree just has too much going on with the chopped-off wide branches and the moss and vines hanging from it, and also the leaves on the lower half. The one on the left is beautifully simple.</td>', 'The bold shapes vs. the fluffy clouds are a good contrast, but my favorite part of the photo is the left half. I don''t know if you had the time to wait until some of the ''sentries'' flew over and landed on that more barren tree, but if you had done and somehow composed to have the clouds behind that tree I think it would have improved this. The other tree just has too much going on with the chopped-off wide branches and the moss and vines hanging from it, and also the leaves on the lower half. The one on the left is beautifully simple.', '2014-10-11 18:10:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7272297, 1131674, 124982, '<td valign="top">Lovely image, with soft lighting and low-contrast. A great representation of <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=75618" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">odriew</a> processing.</td>', 'Lovely image, with soft lighting and low-contrast. A great representation of  odriew processing.', '2014-10-11 18:11:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7272298, 1131935, 124982, '<td valign="top">Splendid capture....absolutely love this composition!! Beautiful soft lighting and lovely toning! Doesn''t quite scream <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=75618" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">odriew</a> to me, but not marking down. Top score and image in the challenge so far!</td>', 'Splendid capture....absolutely love this composition!! Beautiful soft lighting and lovely toning! Doesn''t quite scream  odriew to me, but not marking down. Top score and image in the challenge so far!', '2014-10-11 18:12:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7272301, 1131857, 13077, '<td valign="top">I don''t care for this one. The scene doesn''t lend itself well enough to this lo-fi treatment in my opinion - strong shapes and patterns, usually on a large scale relative to the frame - that don''t depend on detail being kept in the image work a lot better.<br/> <br/>This is a photo that would depend on details to be effective.</td>', 'I don''t care for this one. The scene doesn''t lend itself well enough to this lo-fi treatment in my opinion - strong shapes and patterns, usually on a large scale relative to the frame - that don''t depend on detail being kept in the image work a lot better. This is a photo that would depend on details to be effective.', '2014-10-11 18:14:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7272302, 1132034, 13077, '<td valign="top">Nicely lit and composed, and I like the processing for the most part but might have done without the diagonal noise-like patterns. The overall feel is good, as are the tones.</td>', 'Nicely lit and composed, and I like the processing for the most part but might have done without the diagonal noise-like patterns. The overall feel is good, as are the tones.', '2014-10-11 18:15:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7272303, 1131933, 124982, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image -- just a splendid composition that benefits greatly from the choice of processing. Top 5 for me/</td>', 'Beautiful image -- just a splendid composition that benefits greatly from the choice of processing. Top 5 for me/', '2014-10-11 18:16:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7272304, 1131890, 124982, '<td valign="top">Lovely use of long exposure! Nicely done!</td>', 'Lovely use of long exposure! Nicely done!', '2014-10-11 18:17:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7272305, 1131947, 124982, '<td valign="top">Bizarre.....and beautiful!!</td>', 'Bizarre.....and beautiful!!', '2014-10-11 18:18:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7272306, 1131938, 13077, '<td valign="top">It''s tough to see what''s going on here; what the photo is of and what the idea is.<br/>Visually speaking, I''m not crazy about it. I don''t find the tones very appealing, and I don''t ''get'' it.</td>', 'It''s tough to see what''s going on here; what the photo is of and what the idea is.Visually speaking, I''m not crazy about it. I don''t find the tones very appealing, and I don''t ''get'' it.', '2014-10-11 18:18:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7272307, 1131926, 13077, '<td valign="top">These patterns are very pretty, but it seems like some digital zoom or bad processing has done away with most of your detail here.</td>', 'These patterns are very pretty, but it seems like some digital zoom or bad processing has done away with most of your detail here.', '2014-10-11 18:19:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7272311, 1131888, 13077, '<td valign="top">I like this. Bold colors, strong striking shapes and excellent composition. I like that the men are just out-of-focus enough - you''ve done an excellent job bringing three dimensions of a street scene into two with something very visually pleasing.</td>', 'I like this. Bold colors, strong striking shapes and excellent composition. I like that the men are just out-of-focus enough - you''ve done an excellent job bringing three dimensions of a street scene into two with something very visually pleasing.', '2014-10-11 18:21:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7272312, 1131703, 13077, '<td valign="top">Good processing for the most part, but I think the subject really gets lost against the lake with the color shirt he''s wearing.</td>', 'Good processing for the most part, but I think the subject really gets lost against the lake with the color shirt he''s wearing.', '2014-10-11 18:22:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7272314, 1131992, 13077, '<td valign="top">I really like this.  One of my favorites, it''s so simple but it''s art.</td>', 'I really like this.  One of my favorites, it''s so simple but it''s art.', '2014-10-11 18:23:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7272316, 1131679, 13077, '<td valign="top">It''s very sharp, and the exposure is good, but I don''t see how it relates to the challenge of being in odriew''s style.</td>', 'It''s very sharp, and the exposure is good, but I don''t see how it relates to the challenge of being in odriew''s style.', '2014-10-11 18:25:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7272319, 1131819, 13077, '<td valign="top">This is excellent, I like it very much. Love the stately beheading victim standing in the sun and the man selling(?) balloons, and excellent composition and exposure for the rest of the scene.</td>', 'This is excellent, I like it very much. Love the stately beheading victim standing in the sun and the man selling(?) balloons, and excellent composition and exposure for the rest of the scene.', '2014-10-11 18:27:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7272322, 1132008, 13077, '<td valign="top">It''s a good photo of the mountaintop, and I do like the color overlaid on it, but it seems like a stretch to relate it to this challenge; his style seems to include some human element in every primarily landscape photo.</td>', 'It''s a good photo of the mountaintop, and I do like the color overlaid on it, but it seems like a stretch to relate it to this challenge; his style seems to include some human element in every primarily landscape photo.', '2014-10-11 18:28:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7272323, 1132020, 13077, '<td valign="top">I''m not crazy about the processing on this one - it''s hard on the eyes, and there isn''t enough contrast. A less saturated treatment and some careful use of dodge/burn or a couple curves layers with gradient masks could have helped.<br/>Also, someone walking down the path of leaves would have made me identify it more with odriew''s style.</td>', 'I''m not crazy about the processing on this one - it''s hard on the eyes, and there isn''t enough contrast. A less saturated treatment and some careful use of dodge/burn or a couple curves layers with gradient masks could have helped.Also, someone walking down the path of leaves would have made me identify it more with odriew''s style.', '2014-10-11 18:30:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7272337, 1131717, 124982, '<td valign="top">Great point of view and unusual perspective. The composition and processing really blend nicely together!</td>', 'Great point of view and unusual perspective. The composition and processing really blend nicely together!', '2014-10-11 19:09:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7272338, 1131703, 124982, '<td valign="top">Not so much a fan of the subject with outstretched arms (too forced), but love the soft focus and warm lighting.</td>', 'Not so much a fan of the subject with outstretched arms (too forced), but love the soft focus and warm lighting.', '2014-10-11 19:10:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7272340, 1132031, 124982, '<td valign="top">Non-traditional perspective....and I like it. Voyeuristic to some degree. Goes nicely with the soft, low-contrast processing and choice of toning. Could very easily be found in the <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=75618" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">odriew</a> portfolio.</td>', 'Non-traditional perspective....and I like it. Voyeuristic to some degree. Goes nicely with the soft, low-contrast processing and choice of toning. Could very easily be found in the  odriew portfolio.', '2014-10-11 19:11:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7272341, 1132008, 124982, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous toning and secretive subject. Very unusual composition, with the subject almost an after-thought. I''m a big fan.</td>', 'Gorgeous toning and secretive subject. Very unusual composition, with the subject almost an after-thought. I''m a big fan.', '2014-10-11 19:13:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7272348, 1132038, 124982, '<td valign="top">Great minimal composition. For something so simple, it''s actually a very evocative and powerful image. Very nicely done! Upping score.</td>', 'Great minimal composition. For something so simple, it''s actually a very evocative and powerful image. Very nicely done! Upping score.', '2014-10-11 19:41:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7272349, 1131937, 124982, '<td valign="top">Not quite what I would consider an odriew image, but I still really like it. The processing is beautiful ... the grain and softness are quite appealing to my eye. Add that to the understated toning and you have a splendid image.</td>', 'Not quite what I would consider an odriew image, but I still really like it. The processing is beautiful ... the grain and softness are quite appealing to my eye. Add that to the understated toning and you have a splendid image.', '2014-10-11 19:42:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7272350, 1131744, 124982, '<td valign="top">A most bizarre image. You have this delicious contradiction of the peaceful, calm morning/sunset light contrasting with a rather sinister looking impression of a person behind the glass. Very unsettling composition, but quite appealing to me. Nicely done!</td>', 'A most bizarre image. You have this delicious contradiction of the peaceful, calm morning/sunset light contrasting with a rather sinister looking impression of a person behind the glass. Very unsettling composition, but quite appealing to me. Nicely done!', '2014-10-11 19:44:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7272351, 1131848, 124982, '<td valign="top">Lovely soft focus and lighting. Very peaceful composition, but I feel it needs a little something to just give it some pop, as the choice of low contrast processing makes it hard for the eye to settle on a focal point. A nice splash of color or dodging on the house may have been the trick? Critique aside, still love the image!</td>', 'Lovely soft focus and lighting. Very peaceful composition, but I feel it needs a little something to just give it some pop, as the choice of low contrast processing makes it hard for the eye to settle on a focal point. A nice splash of color or dodging on the house may have been the trick? Critique aside, still love the image!', '2014-10-11 19:46:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7272352, 1131922, 124982, '<td valign="top">Just and extraordinary capture! A beautiful slice of life. With the mix of gorgeous processing and the intimate capture of daily life, this absolutely screams <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=75618" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">odriew</a> to me. Well done! Top score for the challenge!<br/> <br/>ETA: finished voting and this is the clear winner. Top score of 9.</td>', 'Just and extraordinary capture! A beautiful slice of life. With the mix of gorgeous processing and the intimate capture of daily life, this absolutely screams  odriew to me. Well done! Top score for the challenge! ETA: finished voting and this is the clear winner. Top score of 9.', '2014-10-11 19:47:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7272355, 1131880, 124982, '<td valign="top">An exceptionally high contrast image which probably won''t do well with the masses, but is a great image in my books. The choice for a toned B&amp;W really makes the viewer focus more on the subject and not distractions like color -- makes one more engaged in the photo. I can almost feel the cold water under my feet!</td>', 'An exceptionally high contrast image which probably won''t do well with the masses, but is a great image in my books. The choice for a toned B&W really makes the viewer focus more on the subject and not distractions like color -- makes one more engaged in the photo. I can almost feel the cold water under my feet!', '2014-10-11 19:51:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7272356, 1132034, 124982, '<td valign="top">Soft and delicate lighting! Just a beautiful image with some complimentary processing!</td>', 'Soft and delicate lighting! Just a beautiful image with some complimentary processing!', '2014-10-11 19:52:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7272357, 1131512, 124982, '<td valign="top">A great portrait! Very fantastical and delicate at once. Wonder what it would have looked like with a warmer feel to it...as if there was a beautiful splash of golden sunshine on her?</td>', 'A great portrait! Very fantastical and delicate at once. Wonder what it would have looked like with a warmer feel to it...as if there was a beautiful splash of golden sunshine on her?', '2014-10-11 19:53:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7272358, 1131592, 124982, '<td valign="top">An interesting composition and choice of processing. I want to like it, but feel like there''s discord between the image and the title (she''s not jumping?). Also wish the processing of the background was carried over through the model. It looks like you''ve masked her off which makes her disjointed from the frame, would like to see her more integrated.</td>', 'An interesting composition and choice of processing. I want to like it, but feel like there''s discord between the image and the title (she''s not jumping?). Also wish the processing of the background was carried over through the model. It looks like you''ve masked her off which makes her disjointed from the frame, would like to see her more integrated.', '2014-10-11 19:57:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7272359, 1131791, 124982, '<td valign="top">Calm and peaceful indeed! I like the soft processing, but the image lacks a strong focal point...my eye keeps jumping from bridge to dead tree on right and back again. Maybe some dodging and burning to help draw attention to the bridge?</td>', 'Calm and peaceful indeed! I like the soft processing, but the image lacks a strong focal point...my eye keeps jumping from bridge to dead tree on right and back again. Maybe some dodging and burning to help draw attention to the bridge?', '2014-10-11 19:59:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7272361, 1131872, 124982, '<td valign="top">Really like most things about this composition and the processing, just feel the use of the texture overlay to be a little heavy-handed.</td>', 'Really like most things about this composition and the processing, just feel the use of the texture overlay to be a little heavy-handed.', '2014-10-11 20:08:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7272363, 1132017, 86447, '<td valign="top">My only 10.<br/> <br/>You have reached ... PERFECTION!</td>', 'My only 10. You have reached ... PERFECTION!', '2014-10-11 20:21:11.000000', NULL, 1),
