(7272366, 1131935, 86447, '<td valign="top">8 from me... I love that turning back look in the tall grass.   <br/> <br/>Would have been a 9 if that light spot in the upper portion had been cropped out so it''s not competing with that gorgeous FACE!</td>', '8 from me... I love that turning back look in the tall grass.    Would have been a 9 if that light spot in the upper portion had been cropped out so it''s not competing with that gorgeous FACE!', '2014-10-11 20:22:24.000000', NULL, 1),
