(7272384, 1132031, 86447, '<td valign="top">7 from me.    The scale is a surprise after thinking the top is a close up of rocks... and then the person.   Bing!</td>', '7 from me.    The scale is a surprise after thinking the top is a close up of rocks... and then the person.   Bing!', '2014-10-11 20:26:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7272385, 1131952, 86447, '<td valign="top">7 from me... love this moment.</td>', '7 from me... love this moment.', '2014-10-11 20:26:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7272386, 1131924, 124982, '<td valign="top">Very technically sound image, and very nicely processed! The lighting is beautiful on this! It''s just a touch "staged" for my liking to be an <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=75618" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">odriew</a>. Not deducting points, just my personal interpretation of his candid style. A great portrait nontheless...very dreamy and peaceful.</td>', 'Very technically sound image, and very nicely processed! The lighting is beautiful on this! It''s just a touch "staged" for my liking to be an  odriew. Not deducting points, just my personal interpretation of his candid style. A great portrait nontheless...very dreamy and peaceful.', '2014-10-11 20:26:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7272387, 1131872, 86447, '<td valign="top">7 from me... lovely image.  Makes me sad.</td>', '7 from me... lovely image.  Makes me sad.', '2014-10-11 20:27:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7272388, 1131998, 86447, '<td valign="top">7 from me... love the natural framing.</td>', '7 from me... love the natural framing.', '2014-10-11 20:27:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7272389, 1131713, 86447, '<td valign="top">7 from me.  I love how mundane this is... yet... full of life and joy.</td>', '7 from me.  I love how mundane this is... yet... full of life and joy.', '2014-10-11 20:27:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7272390, 1131997, 86447, '<td valign="top">7 from me... bursts of color in a mundane background.</td>', '7 from me... bursts of color in a mundane background.', '2014-10-11 20:27:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7272391, 1131834, 124982, '<td valign="top">Such a subtle image and processed just as the man himself would have done. Nice low contrast with some lovely duotone colors showing through the shadows and highlights.</td>', 'Such a subtle image and processed just as the man himself would have done. Nice low contrast with some lovely duotone colors showing through the shadows and highlights.', '2014-10-11 20:27:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7272393, 1131950, 86447, '<td valign="top">7 from me... love that sunburst!</td>', '7 from me... love that sunburst!', '2014-10-11 20:28:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7272394, 1131937, 86447, '<td valign="top">7 from me... dreamy...</td>', '7 from me... dreamy...', '2014-10-11 20:28:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7272395, 1131953, 86447, '<td valign="top">7 from me... it''s like you used the clone tool for the girls.  :D</td>', '7 from me... it''s like you used the clone tool for the girls.  :D', '2014-10-11 20:28:36.000000', NULL, 1),
