(7272550, 1132018, 13077, '<td valign="top">Yum! *grabs food and runs off*<br/>Very nice light, but I''m not crazy about the composition with the lady at the left of the frame. A lot of times in odriew''s style an element adds some curiosity and mystery, but in my opinion this one just distracts.</td>', 'Yum! *grabs food and runs off*Very nice light, but I''m not crazy about the composition with the lady at the left of the frame. A lot of times in odriew''s style an element adds some curiosity and mystery, but in my opinion this one just distracts.', '2014-10-12 00:22:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7272551, 1131952, 13077, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed and great moment - love the swan in the water there - and good processing.</td>', 'Nicely composed and great moment - love the swan in the water there - and good processing.', '2014-10-12 00:22:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7272552, 1131947, 13077, '<td valign="top">Very intriguing.</td>', 'Very intriguing.', '2014-10-12 00:23:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7272553, 1131716, 13077, '<td valign="top">I like it - excellent light, soft and muted colors, very well composed and pensive environment portrait. I might prefer a slight lightness boost near the girl''s face, though.</td>', 'I like it - excellent light, soft and muted colors, very well composed and pensive environment portrait. I might prefer a slight lightness boost near the girl''s face, though.', '2014-10-12 00:24:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7272554, 1131872, 13077, '<td valign="top">I like the setup and the lighting here very much, but I''m not crazy about the added texture.</td>', 'I like the setup and the lighting here very much, but I''m not crazy about the added texture.', '2014-10-12 00:25:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7272555, 1131717, 13077, '<td valign="top">I like the composition with all the angles and shapes very much, and the dark hooded figure is perfectly placed. Very mysterious and fascinating, while visually pleasing. One of my favorites so far.</td>', 'I like the composition with all the angles and shapes very much, and the dark hooded figure is perfectly placed. Very mysterious and fascinating, while visually pleasing. One of my favorites so far.', '2014-10-12 00:26:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7272556, 1131945, 13077, '<td valign="top">I''m not crazy about the sky-to-land ratio here. I think a bit more ground or at least having the subject a bit more prominent in the frame (sticking up into the sky more) would have helped.</td>', 'I''m not crazy about the sky-to-land ratio here. I think a bit more ground or at least having the subject a bit more prominent in the frame (sticking up into the sky more) would have helped.', '2014-10-12 00:28:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7272557, 1132006, 13077, '<td valign="top">I''m not crazy about the composition here. I don''t feel like having it vertical and including mostly vines on a wall has added anything.</td>', 'I''m not crazy about the composition here. I don''t feel like having it vertical and including mostly vines on a wall has added anything.', '2014-10-12 00:28:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7272559, 1131503, 13077, '<td valign="top">Very cool - excellent light and processing, and the face in the mirror is fascinating. One of my favorites.</td>', 'Very cool - excellent light and processing, and the face in the mirror is fascinating. One of my favorites.', '2014-10-12 00:29:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7272560, 1131830, 13077, '<td valign="top">Fascinating. I like the tilt/shift effect on this one, and even though the added texture is a bit much, it has the feel of a film double exposure and honestly it really works in this case. Excellent job overall.</td>', 'Fascinating. I like the tilt/shift effect on this one, and even though the added texture is a bit much, it has the feel of a film double exposure and honestly it really works in this case. Excellent job overall.', '2014-10-12 00:30:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7272561, 1132017, 13077, '<td valign="top">These boots were made for walkin''...</td>', 'These boots were made for walkin''...', '2014-10-12 00:31:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7272562, 1131968, 13077, '<td valign="top">I get a doomsday vibe from this post processing. Where are the zombies!?</td>', 'I get a doomsday vibe from this post processing. Where are the zombies!?', '2014-10-12 00:31:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7272563, 1131914, 13077, '<td valign="top">Very cool - most of it almost blends in with the DPC background color, I''m guessing that was intentional.</td>', 'Very cool - most of it almost blends in with the DPC background color, I''m guessing that was intentional.', '2014-10-12 00:32:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7272564, 1131511, 13077, '<td valign="top">I know photographing kids at play can be a fight waiting to happen so you were probably forced to be discreet and quick, but this doesn''t have much to offer in the visual strength department.</td>', 'I know photographing kids at play can be a fight waiting to happen so you were probably forced to be discreet and quick, but this doesn''t have much to offer in the visual strength department.', '2014-10-12 00:34:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7272565, 1131674, 13077, '<td valign="top">Interesting - I like the slice of life with everybody doing their own thing and the out-of-focus person at left. Nice light and processing.</td>', 'Interesting - I like the slice of life with everybody doing their own thing and the out-of-focus person at left. Nice light and processing.', '2014-10-12 00:34:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7272567, 1131526, 13077, '<td valign="top">Very well composed and good light - appealing photo. Not 100% sure about the ''in the style of'' aspect, but it''s probably in the post-processing I''m guessing.</td>', 'Very well composed and good light - appealing photo. Not 100% sure about the ''in the style of'' aspect, but it''s probably in the post-processing I''m guessing.', '2014-10-12 00:35:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7272568, 1131512, 13077, '<td valign="top">Very cool composition, I like how she''s pushed to the edge of the frame and her legs look like she''s in an invisible bathtub. As a matter of  fact, what if she''s in a bathtub and the field of flowers and leaves is all a dream!</td>', 'Very cool composition, I like how she''s pushed to the edge of the frame and her legs look like she''s in an invisible bathtub. As a matter of  fact, what if she''s in a bathtub and the field of flowers and leaves is all a dream!', '2014-10-12 00:37:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7272569, 1131590, 13077, '<td valign="top">I like the tones and processing here very much, and the small and aloof human element adds a lot to it.</td>', 'I like the tones and processing here very much, and the small and aloof human element adds a lot to it.', '2014-10-12 00:38:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7272570, 1132030, 13077, '<td valign="top">I don''t get the title, but the processing looks good and the overall environment you''ve created here is a fascinating take on what could be easily overlooked by many of us.</td>', 'I don''t get the title, but the processing looks good and the overall environment you''ve created here is a fascinating take on what could be easily overlooked by many of us.', '2014-10-12 00:38:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7272571, 1131986, 13077, '<td valign="top">I like the scene but something about her pose seems awkward, and I think the ''glow'' added is a little too much, and it''s maybe a little too dark overall.</td>', 'I like the scene but something about her pose seems awkward, and I think the ''glow'' added is a little too much, and it''s maybe a little too dark overall.', '2014-10-12 00:39:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7272572, 1131856, 13077, '<td valign="top">Interesting light and composition here. I like it.</td>', 'Interesting light and composition here. I like it.', '2014-10-12 00:40:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7272573, 1131689, 13077, '<td valign="top">I like the light play and varying poses and activities each of the humans and the dog are in here, it''s a nicely captured slice of life.</td>', 'I like the light play and varying poses and activities each of the humans and the dog are in here, it''s a nicely captured slice of life.', '2014-10-12 00:41:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7272574, 1132005, 13077, '<td valign="top">I like the angle where it''s sort of squared up with the tree - very interesting. Good light as well.</td>', 'I like the angle where it''s sort of squared up with the tree - very interesting. Good light as well.', '2014-10-12 00:41:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7272575, 1131998, 13077, '<td valign="top">Nicely framed with the branches, but I''m not crazy about the overall green color cast.</td>', 'Nicely framed with the branches, but I''m not crazy about the overall green color cast.', '2014-10-12 00:42:14.000000', NULL, 1),
