(7273391, 1131526, 75618, '<td valign="top">I love how delicate and fragile those little branches look. Not too fond of the harsh contrast and lighting</td>', 'I love how delicate and fragile those little branches look. Not too fond of the harsh contrast and lighting', '2014-10-14 01:57:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7273393, 1131592, 75618, '<td valign="top">The background, with the colors, textures and tilted horizon is very interesting. I just wish you would have picked one where she is in a different pose.</td>', 'The background, with the colors, textures and tilted horizon is very interesting. I just wish you would have picked one where she is in a different pose.', '2014-10-14 02:06:15.000000', NULL, 1),
