(7273565, 1132030, 75618, '<td valign="top">I''ve been coming back to this image a few times, trying to come up with an insightful comment as to why this elicits such a positive response from me. First of all, I was always bound to love that warm afternoon glow and the subtle lens flare. This is a lawn like any other lawns in a house like any other houses, but for somebody it is a unique special place. Exceptionally ordinary. <br/> <br/>I am giving this my sole 10 for being my personal favorite in the challenge. 10</td>', 'I''ve been coming back to this image a few times, trying to come up with an insightful comment as to why this elicits such a positive response from me. First of all, I was always bound to love that warm afternoon glow and the subtle lens flare. This is a lawn like any other lawns in a house like any other houses, but for somebody it is a unique special place. Exceptionally ordinary.  I am giving this my sole 10 for being my personal favorite in the challenge. 10', '2014-10-14 20:49:44.000000', NULL, 1),
