(7273631, 1131890, 150277, '<td valign="top">Colors and serious model seem perfect.  I found myself a bit bothered by the placement of the fan, although I do think the fan really added to the image because it made me feel like the day was quite hot and she was worn out.</td>', 'Colors and serious model seem perfect.  I found myself a bit bothered by the placement of the fan, although I do think the fan really added to the image because it made me feel like the day was quite hot and she was worn out.', '2014-10-14 23:10:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7273632, 1131947, 150277, '<td valign="top">I liked a lot of things about this image, especially the light and the interesting story that seems to exist right behind the ladder.  (Is it a ladder? I''m not quite sure what it is.)   But what bothered me a bit was that I could not figure out any real detail of that interesting story.  (It kind of looks like a bunch of sheets or blankets to me - which I just wasn''t sure really was interesting.  Sorry, my brain operates best with really concrete things so abstract is really hard.) But still fabulous image.  8 from me.</td>', 'I liked a lot of things about this image, especially the light and the interesting story that seems to exist right behind the ladder.  (Is it a ladder? I''m not quite sure what it is.)   But what bothered me a bit was that I could not figure out any real detail of that interesting story.  (It kind of looks like a bunch of sheets or blankets to me - which I just wasn''t sure really was interesting.  Sorry, my brain operates best with really concrete things so abstract is really hard.) But still fabulous image.  8 from me.', '2014-10-14 23:14:57.000000', NULL, 1),
