(7274904, 1131914, 100831, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by cutout:</b></div><hr/><i> i wonder,if any anybody saw the bird of peace?<br/>maybe to much to ask :( </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I admit to have missed it at first but I see it now. Lovely. Gentleness.</td>', 'Originally posted by cutout: i wonder,if any anybody saw the bird of peace?maybe to much to ask :(   I admit to have missed it at first but I see it now. Lovely. Gentleness.', '2014-10-18 11:00:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(7275118, 1131937, 46918, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club...<br/> <br/>I must tell you....I am not a big fan of abstracts (grainy pics), however, I do like this. The bird (I assume its an egret)really draws my eye. The water in the foreground is nice. Even though there is a lot of grain the trees are nice and crisp. That is very nice. Overall I think it is a nice image. Keep it up.</td>', 'Hello from the critique club... I must tell you....I am not a big fan of abstracts (grainy pics), however, I do like this. The bird (I assume its an egret)really draws my eye. The water in the foreground is nice. Even though there is a lot of grain the trees are nice and crisp. That is very nice. Overall I think it is a nice image. Keep it up.', '2014-10-18 23:08:08.000000', NULL, 0),
